    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86574" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προαναφων-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pronounce before,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				1.130
			</span></i>(
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>proclaim before, predict,</i> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.662
			</span></i>; <i>announce beforehand,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅτι μέλλει λέγειν</span> Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Vit.Hom.</u>
				163
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>state first,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				228
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>say by way of preface,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pel.</u>
				2
			</span></i>; <i>utter as prelude,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τοῦ</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐμπεδοκλέους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.996b
				</span></i>
			.</div>
